Dear participant,

Thank you for registering to attend the TBI Awareness Seminar. This email
serves as a friendly reminder that the event is scheduled today, November
15, 2024, at 9:00 AM at the PUP Gymnasium.

This event aims to engage and inspire students and faculty by exploring the
essential aspects of technology business incubation, offering insights into
the startup ecosystem, and discussing the resources available to emerging
entrepreneurs within PUP and beyond.

Please find the attached excuse letter in this email, which you can use to
inform your teacher about your absence.

Should you have any concerns, please do not hesitate to contact us at
dscpupstb@gmail.com. Thank you, and we look forward to seeing you at the
event.


Mark Jayson Agao

*Chief Operations Officer*

Iskonnovators Student Community - PUPSTC (formerly GDSC)

A. Bonifacio Street, Sto. Tomas City Batangas

--000000000000b1387a0626e66e6a
